0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 71.6 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 13.5 TL (The AI-Based Government Budget Utilization Monitoring System \(GBMS\) is a full-stack web application designed to) Tj T* (monitor budget allocation and expenditure data in a structured and role-aware manner. The platform provides) Tj T* (dashboards, department-wise utilization, category analysis, monthly spending trends, expenditure records, alerts,) Tj T* (CSV/PDF reports, configurable anomaly thresholds, and administrative audit logs. The application uses Angular,) Tj T* (Node.js/Express, MongoDB Atlas, JWT authentication and role-based access control. It is an academic prototype) Tj T* (and does not represent live government transaction records.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 649.7008 cm
q
.090196 .211765 .364706 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm /F2 16 Tf 20 TL (2. INTRODUCTION) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 602.2008 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 31.1 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 13.5 TL (Public-sector budgeting involves allocation of funds to departments and monitoring of expenditure against approved) Tj T* (budgets. GBMS provides a demonstrable centralized software workflow for storing budget and expenditure records,) Tj T* (presenting analytics, restricting access by role, detecting rule-based anomalies and generating reports.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 572.2008 cm
q
.090196 .211765 .364706 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm /F2 16 Tf 20 TL (3. PROBLEM STATEMENT) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 511.2008 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 44.6 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 13.5 TL (Manual or disconnected budget-monitoring workflows can make it difficult to compare allocation with actual) Tj T* (expenditure, identify unusual spending patterns, restrict access by responsibility and prepare consolidated reports.) Tj T* (GBMS addresses these software-level requirements through centralized storage, role-aware APIs and automated) Tj T* (checks.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 481.2008 cm
q
.090196 .211765 .364706 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm /F2 16 Tf 20 TL (4. OBJECTIVES) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 433.7008 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 31.1 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 13.5 TL (The main objectives are: centralized department, budget and expenditure records; annual and quarterly budgets;) Tj T* (Admin, Finance Officer and Department Head roles; utilization calculation; configurable anomaly detection;) Tj T* (dashboard analytics; CSV/PDF reporting; audit logging; and browser-based deployment.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 403.7008 cm
q
.090196 .211765 .364706 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm /F2 16 Tf 20 TL (5. SCOPE) Tj T* ET
