Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 356.2008 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 31.1 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 13.5 TL (The system covers authentication, departments, budgets, expenditures, document support, anomaly detection,) Tj T* (alerts, dashboard analytics, reports, threshold configuration, user status management and audit logging. It does not) Tj T* (directly integrate with government treasury systems or live government financial databases.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 326.2008 cm
q
.090196 .211765 .364706 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm /F2 16 Tf 20 TL (6. EXISTING VS PROPOSED SYSTEM) Tj T* ET
