Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 278.7008 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 31.1 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 13.5 TL (The proposed system replaces disconnected spreadsheet-style monitoring with a centralized MongoDB database,) Tj T* (JWT-based role access, automated utilization calculations, rule-based anomaly detection, dashboard analytics,) Tj T* (downloadable reports and audit logs.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 248.7008 cm
