BT 1 0 0 1 0 17.6 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 13.5 TL (Authentication; department management; annual/quarterly budgets; expenditure CRUD; alert listing and resolution;) Tj T* (dashboard summaries and charts; CSV/PDF reports; administrative user, threshold and audit-log management.) Tj T* ET
Q
