BT 1 0 0 1 0 31.1 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 13.5 TL (Frontend: Angular, TypeScript, HTML and CSS. Charts: Chart.js with ng2-charts. Backend: Node.js and Express.js.) Tj T* (Database: MongoDB Atlas with Mongoose. Security: JWT and bcrypt. Version control: Git/GitHub. Deployment:) Tj T* (GitHub Pages/Vercel and Render.) Tj T* ET
